        "id": "p43-q4-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Write down the values of $\\cos\\angle ACB$ and $\\sin\\angle ACB$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\cos\\angle ACB=\\dfrac35$, $\\sin\\angle ACB=\\dfrac45$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}AC&=\\sqrt{4^2+3^2}=5\\text{ cm}\\\\\\cos\\angle ACB&=\\frac{BC}{AC}=\\frac35\\\\\\sin\\angle ACB&=\\frac{AB}{AC}=\\frac45\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p43-q4-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Find the exact value of $AD$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\sqrt{17}\\text{ cm}$.\n\nUse the cosine rule in $\\triangle ACD$ with $\\cos\\angle ACD=\\dfrac35$.",
          "worked": "Since $\\angle ACD=\\angle ACB$, $\\cos\\angle ACD=\\dfrac35$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}AD^2&=AC^2+CD^2-2(AC)(CD)\\cos\\angle ACD\\\\AD^2&=5^2+2^2-2(5)(2)\\left(\\frac35\\right)\\\\AD^2&=17\\\\AD&=\\sqrt{17}\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 40
      },
      {
        "id": "p43-q4-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "Find the area of the quadrilateral $ABCD$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$10\\text{ cm}^2$.\n\nSplit along $AC$ and add the areas of the two triangles.",
          "worked": "Since $\\angle ACD=\\angle ACB$, $\\sin\\angle ACD=\\dfrac45$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\operatorname{Area}(ABC)&=\\frac12(4)(3)=6\\text{ cm}^2\\\\\\operatorname{Area}(ACD)&=\\frac12(AC)(CD)\\sin\\angle ACD\\\\\\operatorname{Area}(ACD)&=\\frac12(5)(2)\\left(\\frac45\\right)=4\\text{ cm}^2\\\\\\operatorname{Area}(ABCD)&=6+4=10\\text{ cm}^2\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 40
      }
    ]
  },
